<style>
  @page {
    size: A4;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .page {
    width: 794px;
    height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden;
    page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans";
  }
  .page:last-child {
    page-break-after: auto;
  }
  h1, h2, h3 {
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .header-info {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }
  .logo-area {
    text-align: center;
  }
  .contact-info {
    text-align: right;
    font-size: 10pt;
  }
  .memo-header {
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }
  .memo-body {
    line-height: 1.6;
    text-align: justify;
  }
  .signature-block {
    margin-top: 60px;
  }
  .footer {
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 80px;
    font-size: 9pt;
    border-top: 1px solid #ccc;
    padding-top: 20px;
  }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <div class="header-info">
    <div class="logo-area">
      <!-- Placeholder for UAF Logo -->
      <div style="font-size: 40pt; font-weight: bold;">UAF</div>
      <div style="font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold;">CHANCELLOR'S OFFICE</div>
      <div style="font-size: 10pt;">University of Alaska Fairbanks</div>
    </div>
    <div class="contact-info">
      <div data-field="contact.name">{{ contact.name }}</div>
      <div data-field="contact.address_line1">{{ contact.address_line1 }}</div>
      <div data-field="contact.address_line2">{{ contact.address_line2 }}</div>
      <div data-field="contact.phone">{{ contact.phone }}</div>
      <div data-field="contact.email">{{ contact.email }}</div>
      <div data-field="contact.website">{{ contact.website }}</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="memo-header">
    <div style="font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 10px;">MEMORANDUM</div>
    <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
      <p>DATE: <span data-field="memo.date">{{ memo.date }}</span></p>
      <p>TO: <span data-field="memo.to">{{ memo.to }}</span></p>
      <p>FROM: <span data-field="memo.from">{{ memo.from }}</span></p>
      <p>SUBJECT: <span data-field="memo.subject">{{ memo.subject }}</span></p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="memo-body">
    <p>Effective immediately, please ensure that all UAF faculty and administrative/executive recruitments receive a diversity briefing at the outset of the search committee's work from our Office of Diversity and Equal Opportunity. Please contact <span data-field="contact.name_deo">{{ contact.name_deo }}</span>, Director of Diversity and Equal Opportunity to make arrangements at <span data-field="contact.phone_deo">{{ contact.phone_deo }}</span> or <span data-field="contact.email_deo">{{ contact.email_deo }}</span>.</p>
    <p>Diversity, equity, and inclusion are and will continue to be a priority at UAF. Thank you for your attention to this matter. Please share this information with your unit as appropriate.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="signature-block">
    <p>Cc: <span data-field="cc.name_1">{{ cc.name_1 }}</span></p>
    <p>Cc: <span data-field="cc.name_2">{{ cc.name_2 }}</span></p>
  </div>

  <div class="footer">
    <p>Celebrating a century A17–2017</p>
    <p>UA is an AA/EO employer and educational institution and prohibits illegal discrimination against any individual. http://www.alaska.edu/titlecompliance/nondiscrimination/</p>
  </div>
</div>